----------------------

1. OpenCV Zoo face models (not included; downloaded at runtime)

   The optional face-recognition features of nebi-cli (`nebi-cli[pet]`)
   download the following models from https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo
   into the user's cache on first use. They are not distributed with nebi
   and remain under their own licenses:

   - YuNet face detector (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
     License: MIT. Copyright (c) Shiqi Yu and contributors.
   - SFace face recognizer (face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx)
     License: Apache License 2.0.

   See the LICENSE file next to each model in the OpenCV Zoo repository.

